<title>USA: Molten Metal Technology Inc Q1 loss rises.</title>
<headline>Molten Metal Technology Inc Q1 loss rises.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended March 31</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenue				    $4,973,221    $22,373,544</p>
<p> Operating expenses		     24,030,859     23,449,767</p>
<p>Equity income (loss) from affiliate</p>
<p>					     (3,677,953)	  369,312</p>
<p> Loss from operations		 (22,735,591)	(706,911)</p>
<p> Other income, net			 (737,737)	  922,339</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		    (23,473,328)	  215,428</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share		(1.00)	   (0.01)</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			     23,556,029     27,493,890</p>
<p>NOTE - The company also released on Thursday its 1996 full year results, which it said were delayed because of restructuring of M4 Environmental LP, the limited partnership between Molten and Lockheed Martin Corp</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
